# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local development defaults — committed on purpose (decisions §137).
#
# Loaded by main.go's loadEnvFiles(".env.local", ".env.development") at
# startup: any var NOT already in the environment is taken from here. Your
# gitignored `.env.local` (real secrets) wins; the shell / Fly secrets win
# over both. In production only the compiled binary ships (multi-stage
# Dockerfile) so neither file is present — Fly secrets are the sole source.
#
# Everything below is non-secret: the service-role key + JWT secret are the
# STANDARD PUBLIC Supabase local demo values (identical on every machine) and
# every URL is loopback. Need a real key (Strava, VAPID, SMTP auth)? Put it in
# a gitignored `.env.local`; don't edit this file for machine-specific values.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
# Standard public Supabase local demo service-role key — safe to commit.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZS1kZW1vIiwicm9sZSI6InNlcnZpY2Vfcm9sZSIsImV4cCI6MTk4MzgxMjk5Nn0.EGIM96RAZx35lJzdJsyH-qQwv8Hdp7fsn3W0YpN81IU
# Standard local demo JWT secret — used by the live-hub authorizer (HS256).
SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET=super-secret-jwt-token-with-at-least-32-characters-long
APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:7777
WORKER_ID=dev

# OSRM map-matching. Empty disables the map_match handler; point this at the
# local osrm/ stack (see osrm/README) when you want to exercise matching.
OSRM_URL=

# Email → local Supabase Mailpit catcher (http://127.0.0.1:54324). Left empty
# so the worker drains notification_email jobs to done without sending; set
# SMTP_HOST=127.0.0.1 in .env.local to deliver into Mailpit.
SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=54325
SMTP_FROM=Threkir <noreply@threkir.com>

# Third-party + web-push: empty locally (handlers skip / leave rows pending).
STRAVA_CLIENT_ID=
STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET=
STRAVA_VERIFY_TOKEN=
STRAVA_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:ops@threkir.com
